# Keep the API/web image build context lean and secret-free.
# NOTE: Allgud/ source is kept (the web image builds from it) but node_modules
# and dist are dropped (the web build runs npm ci itself).
bot/
**/node_modules
Allgud/dist/
scratch/
tests/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.db
*.sqlite
data/
.env
*.original.md
DESIGN_BRIEF.md
DEPLOY.md
COMMISSIONING_RUNBOOK.md
